  "notes": [
    "Adds an updater-safe Windows start-bazaarflip.bat to the update bundle so older 0.6.5 installations can restart the new server instead of rolling back.",
    "This is a compatibility bridge specifically for desktops stuck on v0.6.5 after the 60-second restart timeout.",
    "Keeps the direct Node restart updater introduced in v0.6.6 for future updates.",
    "Includes all Minion Calculator fixes and global-search-rank behavior from v0.6.6 and v0.6.7."
